 " \[LongDash] the option list a substrate backdrop is drawn with at a given \
size"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"04f0e0c7-8020-44d3-b6bd-f9922f0b1022"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["InfraSubstrateCode",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the held code behind a named substrate, which evaluates to the \
same graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"db146564-759f-4ea9-9481-be6d44a6898d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Tessellation graphs", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"db9573fe-4518-469d-aea0-25c0069f4033"],

Cell[TextData[{
