 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the smallest regular map of type {p, q}, or the uniform map of a vertex \
configuration, as a graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"e23e7c55-2d53-4879-afd2-8dfef24bba91"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
